    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Year 3</p>
      <h2 class="prog-section__heading">Build the <span class="nb">Pre-IB</span> Foundation in Year 3</h2>
      <p class="prog-section__sub">Year 3 lays the algebraic and geometric groundwork the IB Diploma will later demand &mdash; taught with the precision and full working that distinguish strong IB candidates from the start.</p>

      <div class="card-grid card-grid--1">
        <div class="prog-card">
          <h3 class="prog-card__title">Year 3 Foundation Programme</h3>
          <p class="prog-card__desc">Small group online sessions that build the core mathematical fluency every pre-IB student needs &mdash; starting with indices and the laws of exponents, then algebraic expansion and factorisation, radicals and surds, and Pythagoras&rsquo; theorem. Your child learns to set out full, annotated working from day one &mdash; the &lsquo;state the rule, then apply it&rsquo; habit that A-Worthy&rsquo;s own solution manuals are built around, where every line carries a short &lsquo;Why:&rsquo; explaining the move. By the end of Year 3, the foundations for logarithms, trigonometry and calculus are firmly in place.</p>
          <ul class="prog-card__topics">
            <li>Indices and the laws of exponents</li>
            <li>Sets and Venn diagrams</li>
            <li>Algebraic expansion and factorisation</li>
            <li>Radicals and surds (including rationalising the denominator)</li>
            <li>Pythagoras&rsquo; theorem and its applications</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="prog-card__meta">
            <span>90 min / week</span>
            <span>Max 6 students</span>
            <span>100% online</span>
          </div>
          <p class="prog-card__fee">SGD 280 / month</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

