      <h2 class="prog-section__heading">Step Up to Logarithms, Trigonometry &amp; Calculus in Year 4</h2>
      <p class="prog-section__sub">Year 4 introduces the analytical heavy-hitters &mdash; logarithms, exponentials, trigonometry, and a first encounter with calculus &mdash; the topics that separate confident IB candidates from the rest.</p>

